==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|fr}}/{{etyl|frm|fr}} {{term|beste|lang=fro}}, probably partially borrowed from Classical {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|bestia||lang=la}}. Cf. {{term|biche|lang=fr}} (possibly from Old French {{term|bisse|lang=fro}}, itself from Vulgar Latin {{recons|bistia|lang=VL.|sc=Latn}}; compare Italian {{term|biscia|lang=it}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-bête.ogg|audio (France)}}
* {{audio|Qc-bête.ogg|audio (Canada)}}
* {{IPA|lang=fr|/bɛt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/bEt/}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|f|sort=bete}}

# [[beast]], [[animal]]

