===Adjective===
{{fr-adj|mf|sort=bete}}

# Not very [[bright]] and lacking in [[judgement]]; [[stupid]]; [[inept]].
# Which could have been easily [[averted]]; [[silly]].
# {{Canada|informal|lang=fr|sort=bete}} Having a bad [[character]] or in a bad [[mood]]; showing great [[displeasure]] in interacting with people; [[ill-tempered]].
#* {{quote-book|year=1999|author=[[w:Chrystine Brouillet|Chrystine Brouillet]]|title=Les Fiancées de l'Enfer|isbn=2-89021-363-3|page=69|passage=''Je dis ça, mais depuis quelques semaines elle est moins '''bête'''. Même avec moi'' — I say that, but these last few weeks she hasn't been as nasty. Even with me.}}

